\newlabel{fig:1}{{1}{4}{Schematic overview of the FloatSOM methods framing used in this manuscript. Sample selection and topology definition have configurable components that feed into the standard SOM training step, while the compute architecture determines how that same training procedure is executed in practice. The options shown here summarize the FloatSOM configurations discussed in the following subsections}{figure.1}{}}
