\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {S3}{\ignorespaces Hexagonal FloatSOM--XPySOM implementation calibration. Panels A-C report paired $QE$ effects for $QE_B$, $QE_H$, and $QE_T$. Panel D reports dataset-level median runtime deltas against dataset size, where each numbered dot is the median matched-seed value of \texttt  {FloatSOM time - XPySOM time}; negative values favor FloatSOM and positive values favor XPySOM. The point numbers map to Supplementary Table S6. Forest whiskers denote exact distribution-free 95\% intervals for the paired Wilcoxon location estimate.}}{33}{figure.supplementaryfigure.3}\protected@file@percent }
